{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/12ca2e2b57aa86428bf27ee8201552d7.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Jank Footy</strong> is an absurd and over-the-top arcade sports game.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score a goal? Your opponent picks a game-changing power-up.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hinder your opponents, increase your footy abilities with powers that give your team strong legs, or turn the gameplay completely on its head by transforming everyone into footballs \u2013 the choice is yours!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outplay, out-kick, and out-jank your mates in local multiplayer. Or, if you\u2019re shy,  conquer single-player season mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/18147b563eace7d1b3b0c9d3cc7dd297.poster.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/18147b563eace7d1b3b0c9d3cc7dd297.webm?t=1771556091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/18147b563eace7d1b3b0c9d3cc7dd297.mp4?t=1771556091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUSTRALIAN RULES FOOTBALL LIKE YOU'VE NEVER SEEN IT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Australian Footy is the most attended domestic sports league in the world! 36 players on a field, an obscenely large oval, and a ball that looks like a sunburnt lemon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those outside the loop, \u201cAussie Rules\u201d could mean anything.<strong> </strong>Pro Jank Footy takes this confusion and runs with it\u2014a fast-paced, comedic sports game where you're constantly changing the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/1ee46dfe1e2adec5177f313e4cb2ea83.poster.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/1ee46dfe1e2adec5177f313e4cb2ea83.webm?t=1771556091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/1ee46dfe1e2adec5177f313e4cb2ea83.mp4?t=1771556091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD-CLASS COMEDY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With commentating from Aunty Donna's Broden Kelly and the creative minds of\u00a0David Ashby and Dario Russo behind cult TV series Danger 5 and Italian Spiderman driving the humor, Pro Jank Footy is jam-packed with comedy, charm and Australianisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/dd76d4af4917c518a16b8ddade769873.poster.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=261 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/dd76d4af4917c518a16b8ddade769873.webm?t=1771556091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUELITE GAMEPLAY</strong> \u2013 Every goal scored lets your opponent choose from over 150+ ridiculous power-ups that completely alter the match. Or, play classic mode for simple, arcade footy with no power-ups.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSUS MODES</strong> \u2013 Face off against AI or challenge your mates in couch co-op and online play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEASON MODE</strong> \u2013 Lead your team through a full season with deck-building mechanics to unlock and customize power-ups as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETRO ARCADE NOSTALGIA</strong> \u2013 Inspired by  classic 90s sports games, blending pixel-perfect action with buttery-smooth modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUELY AUSTRALIAN</strong> \u2013 Aussie Rules meets Aussie humor. It\u2019s chaotic, unpredictable, and proudly embraces Australian culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>MULTIPLE TEAMS &amp; STADIUMS</strong> \u2013 Play as 11 unique teams across 4 iconic stadiums, each with their own quirks, hazards, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/0f26a5663c70009858a25629e09da510.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621330?t=1771556091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621330?t=1771556091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/42a7a8f0ebb43854befa7512408bc4459aa24faa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771556091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/42a7a8f0ebb43854befa7512408bc4459aa24faa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771556091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3767130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/12ca2e2b57aa86428bf27ee8201552d7.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Jank Footy</strong> is an absurd and over-the-top arcade sports game.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score a goal? Your opponent picks a game-changing power-up.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hinder your opponents, increase your footy abilities with powers that give your team strong legs, or turn the gameplay completely on its head by transforming everyone into footballs \u2013 the choice is yours!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outplay, out-kick, and out-jank your mates in local multiplayer. Or, if you\u2019re shy,  conquer single-player season mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/18147b563eace7d1b3b0c9d3cc7dd297.poster.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/18147b563eace7