S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/dd76d4af4917c518a16b8ddade769873.poster.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=261 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/dd76d4af4917c518a16b8ddade769873.webm?t=1771556091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUELITE GAMEPLAY</strong> \u2013 Every goal scored lets your opponent choose from over 150+ ridiculous power-ups that completely alter the match. Or, play classic mode for simple, arcade footy with no power-ups.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSUS MODES</strong> \u2013 Face off against AI or challenge your mates in couch co-op and online play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEASON MODE</strong> \u2013 Lead your team through a full season with deck-building mechanics to unlock and customize power-ups as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETRO ARCADE NOSTALGIA</strong> \u2013 Inspired by  classic 90s sports games, blending pixel-perfect action with buttery-smooth modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUELY AUSTRALIAN</strong> \u2013 Aussie Rules meets Aussie humor. It\u2019s chaotic, unpredictable, and proudly embraces Australian culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>MULTIPLE TEAMS &amp; STADIUMS</strong> \u2013 Play as 11 unique teams across 4 iconic stadiums, each with their own quirks, hazards, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/0f26a5663c70009858a25629e09da510.avif?t=1771556091\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p>","developers":["Powerbomb Games","Tinker Town"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/dfa4229071363e04f80096e9432d530cac020a32/header.jpg?t=1771556091","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 12.04 LTS+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621330/209253547/678f897b1d8cdf2952762d40df8548e12bdea742/1771542559/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771556090","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621330/209253547/678f897b1d8cdf2952762d40df8548e12bdea742/1771542559/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771556090","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621330/209253547/678f897b1d8cdf2952762d40df8548e12bdea742/1771542559/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771556090","id":257290540,"name":"Trailer_Console","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257290540/591e165d0171c9aa60904d3749ed5b3b9d630381/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771556090"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621330/1653763315/3d18c1c5f1dd65145c1989f1a9d7866c072ff60a/1754536688/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754538561","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621330/1653763315/3d18c1c5f1dd65145c1989f1a9d7866c072ff60a/1754536688/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754538561","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621330/1653763315/3d18c1c5f1dd65145c1989f1a9d7866c072ff60a/1754536688/hls_264_m